                    // So digging continues as long as ground=1, regardless of dig input? Or does dig=1 start it, and then it continues?
                    // "starts digging when dig=1". Implies dig=1 is the trigger.
                    // But "will continue digging until it reaches the other side". So once started, it continues even if dig goes 0?
                    // Usually in such specs, once the action starts, it continues until condition met.
                    // We'll assume once digging starts (dig=1 and ground=1), it continues until ground=0.
                    // If dig goes 0 while ground=1, maybe stop digging? spec doesn't specify.
                    // We'll keep digging as long as ground=1 and we were digging.
                    // But we need to track if we are digging.
                    // State 11 means digging. If we stay in 11, we are digging.
                    // If ground=1 and dig=0, maybe transition to walking? spec doesn't say.
